            "kind": "NO_CHANGE",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/terminus.cpp",
                    "line": 518,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Pavithra Barithaya",
                        "email": "pavithrabarithaya07@gmail.com",
                        "username": "Pavithrab7"
                    },
                    "message": "can we make the change to handle multiple sensor names also? (even though we don't support now) since the `sensorNames` is a vector of string."
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/terminus.cpp",
                    "line": 518,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "ChauLy-Vietnam",
                        "email": "chaul@amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "chaul-ampere"
                    },
                    "message": "`getSensorNames` already parses all the names in Sensor Aux Name PDR to that vector of string. Are you suggesting that we provide multiple names to the construction of Compact Numeric Sensor also?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/terminus.cpp",
                    "line": 518,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Pavithra Barithaya",
                        "email": "pavithrabarithaya07@gmail.com",
                        "username": "Pavithrab7"
                    },
                    "message": "correct, `getSensorNames` is returning you a vector of string names. but here we are just using the first name (sensorNames.front) correct? What if in future you have multiple names and we want to handle that here?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/terminus.cpp",
                    "line": 518,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Thu Nguyen",
                        "email": "thu@os.amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "ThuBaNguyen"
                    },
                    "message": "The `Numeric Sensor PDRs` and `Compact numeric sensor PDR` do not support `Composite sensor count` field, so we will not support `multiple sensor name in `addNumericSensor` and `addCompactNumericSensor`.\nAbout `getSensorNames`, it can be used to get the sensor names for `Numeric Sensor PDRs`(single name), `Compact numeric sensor PDR` (single name), `State sensor PDRs`(Can multiple name) and `Effecter PDRs`(Can multiple name)... that why it return vector of sensor name."
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/terminus.cpp",
                    "line": 518,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Pavithra Barithaya",
                        "email": "pavithrabarithaya07@gmail.com",
                        "username": "Pavithrab7"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/terminus.cpp",
                    "line": 518,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "ChauLy-Vietnam",
                        "email": "chaul@amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "chaul-ampere"
                    },
                    "message": "It was my mistake to leave a comment on top of the code line. Remove to avoid confusion."
                }
            ],
